            <div xml:id="ch131">

                <pb facs="0770" n="650" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg650"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and certain American powers for the
                    arbitration of pecuniary claims</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Mexico, January 30, 1902.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification advisedly the Senate, January 11,
                    1905.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by the President of the United States, January
                        28, 1905.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification deposited with the Mexican Government,
                        February 10, 1905.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Proclaimed March 24, 1905.</hi></p>


